  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the pressure cooker to high heat.",
    "Add the coconut oil, garam masala, ground ginger, and salt to the pressure cooker.",
    "Add the peanuts, dates, and honey or maple syrup to the pressure cooker.",
    "Add the water to the pressure cooker and close the lid.",
    "Pressure cook for 15 minutes.",
    "Let the pressure release naturally for 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the pressure cooker from the heat and let the tagine cool slightly.",
    "Transfer the tagine to a hot stone plate and garnish with sliced almonds.",
    "Serve the tagine warm or at room temperature."
